6226       data uspop;
6227       input pop :6.3 @@;
6228       retain year 1780;
6229       year = year+10;
6230       yearsq = year*year;
6231       datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.USPOP has 21 observations and 3 variables.

6235       ;
6236       title 'Beaton/Tukey Biweight Robust Regression using IRLS';
6237       proc nlin data=uspop nohalve;
6238       parms b0=20450.43 b1=-22.7806 b2=.0063456;
6239       model pop=b0+b1*year+b2*year*year;
6240       resid = pop-model.pop;
6241       sigma = 2;
6242       k = 4.685;
6243       if abs(resid/sigma)<=k then _weight_=(1-(resid / (sigma*k))**2)**2;
6244       else _weight_=0;
6245       output out=c r=rbi;
6246       run;

NOTE: DER.b0 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.b1 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
NOTE: DER.b2 not initialized or missing. It will be computed automatically.
